%% Draft diagram. Application verification: NOT_RUN.
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Player
    participant H as Native host
    participant J as Windows Job
    participant C as Local core
    participant V as UI and helpers
    U->>H: Launch
    H->>J: Create, configure and assign 10% CPU cap
    alt Containment setup fails
        J-->>H: Setup error
        H-->>U: Safe error and exit 1
        Note over H,V: No WebView or sidecar creation
    else Containment established
        J-->>H: Contained runtime
        H->>C: Start local services
        H->>V: Create UI and owned helpers
        C-->>V: Separate source and readiness states
        Note over H,C: No account, network or premium gate
        Note over C,V: Optional failures keep valid local functions
    end
